  "productNameAr": "شيلاجيت درجة ذهبية",
  "productNameEn": "Gold Grade Shilajit",
  "contactPerson": "Mr. Michael Rhodes",
  "companyName": "Cornerstone Health Corp More matching enquiries may be available in your Inquiry Manager <https://www.globalbuyersonline.com/inq/> . Upgrade Membership <https://www.globalbuyersonline.com/members/upgradeprofile.asp>",
  "buyerDetails": "We are currently vetting premium wholesale partners in Nepal supplying Gold Grade Shilajit Resin that meets our strict internal \"Pillar of Trust\" standards. We require a product that demonstrates the geological maturity and mineral density characteristic of authentic high-altitude resin. To ensure our brands authority, please confirm if your current batch meets the following technical specifications: 1. Physical Authentication & Burn Test: ?We perform rigorous internal \"Burn Tests\" on all samples. We require resin that bubbles and expands under a mini-torch without igniting. * Critical Requirement We are specifically looking for resin that eventually incinerates into a fine white or light-grey ash, indicating a high ratio of ionic trace minerals to organic carbon. Batches that remain as a solid black charred mass are not suitable for our premium \"Gold Grade\" positioning. 2. Sourcing & Origin: ?Is your resin hand-collected at altitudes above 16,000 ft (4,800m)? ?Which specific mountain range (e.g., Dhaulagiri, Dolpa) is this current batch sourced from? 3. Processing & Analytical Standards: ?We require traditional Surya Tapi (sun-dried) purification maintained below 45C. ?Please provide a batch-specific COA including Fulvic Acid percentage via HPLC and Heavy Metal analysis compliant with USP/Prop 65 standards. ?The resin must be 100% water-soluble with zero sediment or \"grit.\" 4. Bulk Logistics: ?What is your MOQ for raw resin? ?Do you provide Phytosanitary certificates and HPPCL (Herbal Production and Processing Co. Ltd.) verification prior to export? We are looking for a long-term partner who can consistently provide the highest-mineral-density resin in the region. We look forward to receiving your documentation and a sample for our lab and physical testing. Thank you.",
