  "buyerDetails": "We are looking for a long-term supplier and would like to understand your capabilities. Could you please provide the following: - Price per kg for 5 kg, 10 kg and 20 kg quantities - Origin of the Ambunu (country and region if possible) - Whether you source directly from farmers or through local markets - Photos or video of your current stock (raw leaves not only powder) - Information on how the leaves are processed and dried Consistency in mucilage/slip performance is very important for our formulation, so any details on quality control are appreciated. We are currently evaluating multiple suppliers and looking to establish a reliable long-term partnership. Looking forward to your reply. Thank you.",
