  "buyerDetails": "Dear Sir, Hope you are doing well. Our company is a subsidiary of S.N. Engineering & Construction BD Ltd, which has been contributing to Bangladesh construction and trading sectors for over a decade. This dynamic business conglomerate is involved in the construction of small and large-scale projects for the Government of Bangladesh, the Bangladesh Army, and various private and commercial sectors. We specializes in the import and nationwide distribution of essential commodities. Our operations are supported by modern logistics, extensive warehousing facilities, and a highly experienced sales and distribution network. We have a strong sales presence across the country, with our headquarters located in Dhaka, Bangladesh. Our primary product portfolio includes Dyes And Chemicals, Machinery and Spare Parts, Sugar, Wheat, Lentils, Rice, Edible Oil, Maize, Construction Chemicals, and construction equipment. Currently, we import these products from India, Thailand, Australia, Brazil, Malaysia, Canada, and the USA. We are now strategically expanding into premium-quality products. The annual turnover of SN Import & Export BD Ltd. is approximately USD 600 million, and we expect this to grow by 100% in the next financial year. Our operations are supported by: A nationwide warehouse network in key commercial and wholesale districts Climate-controlled storage facilities for perishable and sensitive products A dedicated fleet of logistics vehicles ensuring timely and secure delivery A professional and highly trained sales and distribution team with strong market coverage A robust customer base including wholesalers, retailers, and e-commerce platforms With this infrastructure, we ensure reliable, consistent, and high-quality supply for all our partners. Our strong market reputation, operational excellence, and long-standing supplier relationships make us a preferred partner for international exporters entering the Bangladesh market. As part of our business expansion, we are interested in importing Green Cardamom and cloves in large quantities to Dhaka for nationwide wholesale distribution. Initially, we intend to import a container of Green Cardamom and cloves with the possibility of ongoing orders. We kindly request you to provide us with a quotation along with the following details on a CNF/CIF Chittagong basis: CNF/CIF price to Chittagong Port, Bangladesh Product quality specifications (color, moisture, purity, foreign matter, etc.) Country of origin and crop year Packaging options (bag type, weight, palletization) Minimum order quantity Lead time from order confirmation to shipment Payment terms Sample availability and cost (if applicable) HS code for peeled football red lentils We would appreciate your cooperation in this regard. Kindly also share the contact details of the person or department responsible for international sales and exports. We look forward to your prompt response and to building a mutually beneficial, long-term business relationship. Warm Regards,",
